{
  "_readme": [
    "Build-time provenance for the cover files under public/resources/covers/.",
    "",
    "These third-party URLs live HERE and never in src/. The catalogue only ever",
    "holds the local path we serve ourselves, so no publisher URL can reach a",
    "reader's browser (see docs/RESOURCES.md, Privacy).",
    "",
    "`licence` is the human gate, exactly like `status` in the catalogue:",
    "  unreviewed  nobody has checked whether we may use this artwork - SKIPPED",
    "  cleared     a person confirmed the licence, press kit or written permission",
    "  declined    checked and we may not use it; kept so nobody re-checks it",
    "",
    "`npm run build:covers` fetches only `cleared` entries. Everything else is a",
    "worksheet, and a resource with no cover file draws its generated tile.",
    "",
    "`source` must be the publisher's own product image on the `page` below it."
